  "ExplanationWrongD": "Perfectly elastic (horizontal) demand in every segment means customers will not pay more than one market price — the opposite of what segmentation requires. Price discrimination needs downward-sloping demand curves that differ in elasticity across segments, so Apex Transit can charge each group a different price.",
