  "ExplanationWrongD": "Line Z does NOT cover its allocated fixed costs — allocated costs were excluded from this analysis precisely because they are unavoidable and irrelevant. But the incremental facts decide the question: dropping loses $40,000 of contribution and recovers only $20,000 from the sales shift, a net −$20,000. Covering allocations is not the test; the change in company profit is.",
