  "ExplanationWrongC": "−$16,000 uses the full $50 variable cost (including the commission that the special order does not pay) AND counts the displacement: $124,000 − $100,000 − $40,000 = −$16,000. The commission savings of $4 per unit on all 2,000 units is real and must be included, making the net loss only $8,000.",
